/E (This project aims to develop a Capstone Project Management Web Application. This application will serve as a centralized platform to streamline the administration and management of capstone projects. The application will support project allocation, proposal submissions, communication, and showcasing project outcomes. The proposed solution aims to improve efficiency and reduce administrative workload.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [727]
>>
